{
	"pages": [
		{
			"id": "ExpenseDetail",
			"route": "/expenses/:id",
			"type": "detail",
			"title": "Expense",
			"config": {
				"register": "humaniq",
				"schema": "Expense",
				"_note": "Expense-reimbursement claim (onkostendeclaratie). A single Expense holds one claim (amount / currency / category / date + attached receipt) and a submit -> approve/reject -> reimburse lifecycle (x-openregister-lifecycle on `status`). Content starts at gridY 0 with the 'Claim' data (title/description/amount/currency/category/expenseDate/receiptFile) then 'Approval' (status/submittedAt/approvedBy/approvedAt/rejectionReason/reimbursedAt) below it, both excluding employeeId since Related already resolves the claiming Employee by name; an amount KPI stat sits top-right so the payout figure is unmissable, with Related beneath it matching the combined left-column height. The Files widget (receipt / bon) runs full-width AFTER the domain cards, same placement convention as Timesheet's approval evidence -- the approver reads the claim record first, then opens the receipt to verify it. NO email/calendar/talk -- Expense declares no comms linkedTypes; a reimbursement claim is a financial/HR record, not a correspondence thread. lifecycleActions expose submit/approve/reject/reimburse (approve/reject guarded server-side by NoSelfApprovalGuard; reimburse is terminal). Audit history is a sidebar tab. receipt-ocr (2026-07-16): page-level action \"Extract receipt data\" mirrors PayslipDetail's \"Genereer PDF\" shape -- POST /api/expenses/extract-receipt with {expenseId: @objectId}, guarded server-side by ExpenseController::authorizeExpense() (resolve-first RBAC) then an admin-or-owner ownership check. expenses-travel-calculation (2026-09-29): a 'Travel' data widget at gridY 6 shows the trip (travelType, distanceKm, transportMode, fuelType) and what humaniq calculated from it (ratePerKm, taxFreeAmount, taxableAmount, amountSource, read-only: TravelAmountListener stamps them on save). Approval moves to gridY 10, the receipt to gridY 14, and Related grows to 12 rows to match the left column.",
				"sidebar": {
					"enabled": true,
					"showMetadata": true
				},
				"widgets": [
					{
						"id": "stat",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Claimed amount",
						"icon": "CashMultiple",
						"content": {
							"label": "Claimed amount",
							"caption": "to reimburse",
							"icon": "CashMultiple",
							"valueColor": "#46ba61",
							"format": {
								"style": "currency",
								"currency": "EUR",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"source": {
								"register": "humaniq",
								"schema": "Expense",
								"metric": "sum",
								"field": "amount",
								"filter": {
									"id": "@objectId"
								}
							}
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "files",
						"type": "files",
						"title": "Receipt",
						"icon": "FolderOutline"
					},
					{
						"id": "data",
						"type": "data",
						"title": "Claim",
						"icon": "ClipboardList",
						"content": {
							"columns": 2,
							"include": [
								"title",
								"description",
								"amount",
								"currency",
								"category",
								"expenseDate",
								"receiptFile",
								"vendor",
								"vatAmount"
							],
							"title": "Claim"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "data-3",
						"type": "data",
						"title": "Travel",
						"icon": "CarOutline",
						"content": {
							"columns": 2,
							"include": [
								"travelType",
								"distanceKm",
								"transportMode",
								"fuelType",
								"ratePerKm",
								"taxFreeAmount",
								"taxableAmount",
								"amountSource"
							],
							"title": "Travel",
							"overrides": {
								"ratePerKm": {
									"editable": false
								},
								"taxFreeAmount": {
									"editable": false
								},
								"taxableAmount": {
									"editable": false
								},
								"amountSource": {
									"editable": false
								}
							}
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "data-2",
						"type": "data",
						"title": "Approval",
						"icon": "CheckCircleOutline",
						"content": {
							"columns": 2,
							"include": [
								"status",
								"submittedAt",
								"approvedBy",
								"approvedAt",
								"rejectionReason",
								"reimbursedAt"
							],
							"title": "Approval",
							"overrides": {
								"status": {
									"editable": false
								},
								"submittedAt": {
									"editable": false
								},
								"approvedBy": {
									"editable": false
								},
								"approvedAt": {
									"editable": false
								},
								"reimbursedAt": {
									"editable": false
								}
							}
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "related",
						"type": "related",
						"title": "Related",
						"icon": "LinkVariant",
						"content": {
							"title": "Related"
						}
					}
				],
				"layout": [
					{
						"id": 1,
						"widgetId": "stat",
						"gridX": 8,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridHeight": 2
					},
					{
						"id": 2,
						"widgetId": "files",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 14,
						"gridWidth": 12,
						"gridHeight": 4
					},
					{
						"id": 3,
						"widgetId": "data",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 8,
						"gridHeight": 6
					},
					{
						"id": 4,
						"widgetId": "data-2",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 10,
						"gridWidth": 8,
						"gridHeight": 4
					},
					{
						"id": 5,
						"widgetId": "related",
						"gridX": 8,
						"gridY": 2,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridHeight": 12
					},
					{
						"id": 6,
						"widgetId": "data-3",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 6,
						"gridWidth": 8,
						"gridHeight": 4
					}
				],
				"lifecycleActions": {
					"field": "status",
					"transitions": [
						{
							"action": "submit",
							"from": [
								"draft",
								"rejected"
							],
							"to": "submitted",
							"label": "Submit"
						},
						{
							"action": "approve",
							"from": [
								"submitted"
							],
							"to": "approved",
							"label": "Approve"
						},
						{
							"action": "reject",
							"from": [
								"submitted"
							],
							"to": "rejected",
							"label": "Reject"
						},
						{
							"action": "reimburse",
							"from": [
								"approved"
							],
							"to": "reimbursed",
							"label": "Reimburse"
						}
					]
				},
				"headerActions": [
					{
						"id": "extract-receipt",
						"label": "Extract receipt data",
						"type": "api-call",
						"icon": "TextRecognition",
						"url": "/api/expenses/extract-receipt",
						"method": "POST",
						"params": {
							"expenseId": "@objectId"
						},
						"confirm": true,
						"successMessage": "Extraction started.",
						"errorMessage": "Extraction failed."
					}
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"pageInstances": [
		{
			"templateRef": "indexScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "Expense",
			"params": {
				"id": "Expenses",
				"route": "/expenses",
				"title": "Expenses",
				"columns": [
					"employeeId",
					"title",
					"amount",
					"category",
					"expenseDate",
					"status"
				],
				"sort": {
					"field": "expenseDate",
					"order": "desc"
				},
				"filters": [
					"status",
					"category"
				],
				"filter": {
					"administrationId": "@workspace.activeAdministrationId?"
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"templateRef": "indexScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "CommuteArrangement",
			"params": {
				"id": "CommuteArrangements",
				"route": "/commute-arrangements",
				"title": "Commuting arrangements",
				"columns": [
					"employeeId",
					"distanceKmOneWay",
					"daysPerWeek",
					"transportMode",
					"monthlyAllowance",
					"startDate",
					"status"
				],
				"sort": {
					"field": "startDate",
					"order": "desc"
				},
				"filters": [
					"status",
					"transportMode"
				],
				"filter": {
					"administrationId": "@workspace.activeAdministrationId?"
				},
				"description": "Each employee's commute and the fixed monthly allowance humaniq calculates for it with the 214-day rule."
			}
		},
		{
			"templateRef": "simpleDetailScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "CommuteArrangement",
			"params": {
				"id": "CommuteArrangementDetail",
				"route": "/commute-arrangements/:id",
				"title": "Commuting arrangement",
				"dataTitle": "Commute",
				"dataIcon": "CarOutline",
				"relatedTitle": "Related",
				"gridHeight": 8,
				"note": "expenses-travel-calculation (2026-09-29): one employee's commute. The data widget excludes employeeId (Related resolves it) and shows the calculated allowance read-only (TravelAmountListener stamps it on save). 'Calculate distance' posts {arrangementId: @objectId} to /api/travel/route-distance, which reads the arrangement under the caller's RBAC (404), lets only its employee before approval or HR/admin change it (403), and answers 409 when integriq or its route planner source is absent, keeping the typed distance. lifecycleActions mirror the schema: submit, approve/reject (NoSelfApprovalGuard), end.",
				"exclude": [
					"employeeId",
					"userId",
					"managerUserId"
				],
				"overrides": {
					"monthlyAllowance": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"taxFreeMonthly": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"taxableMonthly": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"ratePerKm": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"routeProvider": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"status": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"approvedBy": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"approvedAt": {
						"editable": false
					}
				},
				"headerActions": [
					{
						"id": "calculate-distance",
						"label": "Calculate distance",
						"type": "api-call",
						"icon": "CarOutline",
						"url": "/api/travel/route-distance",
						"method": "POST",
						"params": {
							"arrangementId": "@objectId"
						},
						"confirm": false,
						"successMessage": "Distance calculated by the route planner.",
						"errorMessage": "No route planner is available, so the distance you typed is kept."
					}
				],
				"lifecycleActions": {
					"field": "status",
					"transitions": [
						{
							"action": "submit",
							"from": [
								"draft",
								"rejected"
							],
							"to": "submitted",
							"label": "Submit"
						},
						{
							"action": "approve",
							"from": [
								"submitted"
							],
							"to": "approved",
							"label": "Approve"
						},
						{
							"action": "reject",
							"from": [
								"submitted"
							],
							"to": "rejected",
							"label": "Reject"
						},
						{
							"action": "end",
							"from": [
								"approved"
							],
							"to": "ended",
							"label": "End"
						}
					]
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"templateRef": "indexScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "WpmReport",
			"params": {
				"id": "WpmReports",
				"route": "/mobility-reports",
				"title": "Mobility reports",
				"columns": [
					"year",
					"administrationId",
					"employeeCount",
					"meetsThreshold",
					"totalBusinessKm",
					"totalCommuteKm",
					"compiledAt"
				],
				"sort": {
					"field": "year",
					"order": "desc"
				},
				"filter": {
					"administrationId": "@workspace.activeAdministrationId?"
				},
				"allowCreate": true,
				"description": "The yearly business and commuting kilometres per transport mode and fuel, for the CO2 reporting duty of employers with 100 or more employees. Add a year, then compile it."
			}
		},
		{
			"templateRef": "simpleDetailScaffold",
			"register": "humaniq",
			"schema": "WpmReport",
			"params": {
				"id": "WpmReportDetail",
				"route": "/mobility-reports/:id",
				"title": "Mobility report",
				"dataTitle": "Mobility report",
				"dataIcon": "ChartBar",
				"relatedTitle": "Related",
				"gridHeight": 10,
				"note": "expenses-travel-calculation (2026-09-29): one administration's yearly WPM figures. 'Compile' posts {administrationId, year} from the object to /api/travel/wpm-report (HR of that administration or an administrator, 403 otherwise), which recomputes businessKm, commuteKm, the headcount against the threshold and tripsWithoutMode, and updates this record. Every figure is read-only: only compiling writes them.",
				"overrides": {
					"employeeCount": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"meetsThreshold": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"businessKm": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"commuteKm": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"totalBusinessKm": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"totalCommuteKm": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"tripsWithoutMode": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"compiledAt": {
						"editable": false
					},
					"compiledBy": {
						"editable": false
					}
				},
				"headerActions": [
					{
						"id": "compile-wpm",
						"label": "Compile",
						"type": "api-call",
						"icon": "ChartBar",
						"url": "/api/travel/wpm-report",
						"method": "POST",
						"params": {
							"administrationId": "@object.administrationId",
							"year": "@object.year"
						},
						"confirm": false,
						"successMessage": "Mobility report compiled.",
						"errorMessage": "The mobility report could not be compiled. Only HR of this administration or an administrator can compile it."
					}
				]
			}
		}
	]
}
